    },
    {
      "speaker": "プロデューサー",
      "text": "「プロデューサーとアイドル、それ以上でも以下でもない関係だろ？」",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_1_p",
        "zh": "（我们只是制作人和偶像的关系，仅此而已吧？）",
        "speakerZh": "制作人",
        "note": "[命题台词] 对 黛冬优子 提问",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1_fuyuko",
        "x-beatTitle": "黛冬优子 的场合"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "ふふっ、プロデューサーさんったら、急に何を言い出すのかしら♡",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile2",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_1_1",
        "zh": "呵呵，制作人先生真是的，怎么突然说出这种话呀♡",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "note": "[初反应] 营业模式完美甜笑",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1_fuyuko",
        "x-beatTitle": "黛冬优子 的场合"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "……はあ！？それ以上でも以下でもないって、ふゆを誰だと思ってるのよ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "anger1",
      "charAnim2": "face_anger",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
      "lip": "lip_anger",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_1_2",
        "zh": "……哈啊！？什么叫仅此而已，你把冬优当成什么人了啊！",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "anger_pout",
        "innerEmotion": "shy_defensive",
        "vocalTone": "crisp_clipped",
        "note": "[反转破防] BGM骤停 · 瞬间切回裏冬优子逼近一步",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1_fuyuko",
        "x-beatTitle": "黛冬优子 的场合"
      },
      "bgm": "off"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "あんたの一番近くにいるのはふゆなんだから、絶対によそ見しないでよね……っ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait2",
      "charAnim2": "face_shy",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
      "lip": "lip_shy",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_1_3",
        "zh": "离你最近的明明是冬优我，绝对不准你把视线移向别人哦……！",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "shy_flustered",
        "innerEmotion": "affection_bashful",
        "vocalTone": "breath_flutter",
        "note": "[直球收尾] 脸颊微红别过视线宣示主权",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1_fuyuko",
        "x-beatTitle": "黛冬优子 的场合"
      },
      "se": "0453"
    },
