    {
      "speaker": "円香",
      "text": "ええ、そうですね。プロデューサーとアイドル、ただのビジネスパートナーですから。",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "madoka",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "021",
      "clothId": "021",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait2",
      "charAnim2": "face_serious",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_2_1",
        "zh": "嗯，是那样没错呢。制作人和偶像，本来就只是纯粹的商业搭档而已。",
        "speakerZh": "樋口圆香",
        "surfaceEmotion": "calm_neutral",
        "innerEmotion": "resolve_quiet",
        "vocalTone": "calm_even",
        "note": "[初反应] 波澜不惊地冷淡附和",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2_madoka",
        "x-beatTitle": "樋口圆香 的场合"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "円香",
      "text": "……わざわざ口に出して線を引くなんて、プロデューサー、何か後ろめたいことでも？",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "madoka",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "021",
      "clothId": "021",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait3",
      "charAnim2": "face_close",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_2_2",
        "zh": "……特意说出口来划清界限，制作人，您是有什么心虚的事吗？",
        "speakerZh": "樋口圆香",
        "surfaceEmotion": "troubled_sigh",
        "innerEmotion": "guarded_distance",
        "vocalTone": "sigh_trail",
        "note": "[反转刺探] 半眯起眼冷冷盯住制作人",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2_madoka",
        "x-beatTitle": "樋口圆香 的场合"
      },
      "bgm": "off"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "円香",
      "text": "ふーん……まあ、わたしは最初から期待なんてしていませんけど。",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "madoka",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "021",
      "clothId": "021",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
