      "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
      "lip": "lip_sad",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "rx_8_2",
        "zh": "……咦，请等一下。您这么说，该不会是准备丢下不管我的铺垫吧……？",
        "speakerZh": "七草日花",
        "surfaceEmotion": "sad_downcast",
